  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">此資源包專為人氣模組「Ice and Fire: Dragons In a whole new light!」所設計&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">其目標是為該模組的貼圖賦予嶄新外觀，同時維持 Minecraft 與該模組本身的原版風格。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">是的，您可以將此貼圖包用於您的整合包。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/307316850952241162/828727843299000370/firedragonflying.png\" alt=\"火龍貼圖重製\" width=\"654\" height=\"568\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">您不得重新發布或修改這些貼圖。&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
